<Positioned left="48" top="156" width="1104" height="58"><Container width="1104" height="58" alignment="CENTER_LEFT"><Text fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontSize="40" color="#18283F" textAlign="LEFT" softWrap="true" fontStyle="BOLD"><![CDATA[把一段文本 POST 成一张 PNG]]></Text></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="48" top="222" width="1104" height="78"><Container width="1104" height="78" alignment="CENTER_LEFT"><Text fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontSize="26" color="#5B6B85" textAlign="LEFT" softWrap="true"><![CDATA[open-snapshot 只有一个渲染入口。请求体是 UTF-8 纯文本 DSL，不是 JSON、不是 HTML。]]></Text></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="53" top="321" width="14" height="14"><Container color="#245CE4" borderRadius="7" /></Positioned>
<Positioned left="84" top="308" width="1060" height="78"><Container width="1060" height="78" alignment="CENTER_LEFT"><Text fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontSize="24" color="#18283F" textAlign="LEFT" softWrap="true"><![CDATA[1  POST /snapshot，Content-Type: text/plain; charset=utf-8；成功返回 image/png 原始字节。]]></Text></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="53" top="413" width="14" height="14"><Container color="#245CE4" borderRadius="7" /></Positioned>
<Positioned left="84" top="400" width="1060" height="78"><Container width="1060" height="78" alignment="CENTER_LEFT"><Text fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontSize="24" color="#18283F" textAlign="LEFT" softWrap="true"><![CDATA[2  用 X-Request-Id 关联日志；失败返回带 code / message / requestId 的 JSON，按 code 判断类型。]]></Text></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="53" top="505" width="14" height="14"><Container color="#245CE4" borderRadius="7" /></Positioned>
<Positioned left="84" top="492" width="1060" height="78"><Container width="1060" height="78" alignment="CENTER_LEFT"><Text fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontSize="24" color="#18283F" textAlign="LEFT" softWrap="true"><![CDATA[3  默认不要加 ?errorImage=png：它会把解析错误伪装成图片，程序无法读取错误正文。]]></Text></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="53" top="597" width="14" height="14"><Container color="#245CE4" borderRadius="7" /></Positioned>
<Positioned left="84" top="584" width="1060" height="78"><Container width="1060" height="78" alignment="CENTER_LEFT"><Text fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontSize="24" color="#18283F" textAlign="LEFT" softWrap="true"><![CDATA[4  根节点必须是 <Snapshot>，画布尺寸由内部布局决定，type 可为 png / jpg / webp。]]></Text></Container></Positioned>
